# Trust-anchor PEM bundle for Provenance Lens.
#
# EMPTY ON PURPOSE: with no certificates here, no signature chain can
# validate as trusted, and signed assets honestly report as unverifiable
# provenance. Milestone 4 decides how the production C2PA trust list
# (https://github.com/c2pa-org/conformance-public/tree/main/trust-list)
# is distributed and updated.
#
# For the local M3 smoke test ONLY, temporarily copy the test CA here:
#     cp crates/provenance-core/tests/vectors/test_ca.pem extension/trust/anchors.pem
# and restore this placeholder afterwards:
#     git checkout extension/trust/anchors.pem
